---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
import { isTodo } from '../lib/format';

const crumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
  { name: 'Terms', path: '/terms/' },
];
const updated = 'September 2026';
const brokerageMissing = isTodo(site.brokerage.legalName);
---

<Page
  title="Terms of Use | Kirby Chan & Co. Markham"
  description="Terms of use for kirbychanmarkham.com, including market data disclaimers, the limits of the information published here and brokerage registration details."
  eyebrow="Legal"
  h1="Terms of use"
  accent="Terms"
  lede={`What this website is, what it is not and the limits of the information on it. Last updated ${updated}.`}
  crumbs={crumbs}
  tone="sand"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap-narrow prose">
      <div class="notice">
        <p>
          <strong>Have a lawyer review this before launch.</strong> These terms describe how this
          website works and the disclaimers that apply to it. They are not legal advice and they
          have not been reviewed by counsel.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Who publishes this site</h2>
      <p>
        This website is published by {site.name}{brokerageMissing ? ' [TODO: brokerage legal name]' : `, ${site.brokerage.legalName}`}.
        Registered office: {site.office.street}, {site.office.city}, {site.office.region}{' '}
        {site.office.postalCode}.
      </p>
      {
        !brokerageMissing && (
          <p>{site.brokerage.disclosure}</p>
        )
      }
      <p>
        Real estate services in Ontario are regulated under the Trust in Real Estate Services Act
        and administered by the Real Estate Council of Ontario.
      </p>

      <h2>General information only</h2>
      <p>
        Everything on this site is general information about real estate in Markham. It is not
        legal advice, not tax advice, not mortgage advice, not accounting advice and not investment
        advice. It is not a substitute for professional advice about your own circumstances and
        you should not act on it without getting that advice.
      </p>

      <h2>Market data</h2>
      <p>
        Price figures, medians, averages and market commentary published on this site are general
        information drawn from Toronto Regional Real Estate Board data for the periods stated. They
        are compiled from sources believed to be reliable and they are not guaranteed.
      </p>
      <p>
        These figures are not an appraisal and not an opinion of value for any particular property.
        A neighbourhood median says nothing about the value of a specific home, its lot, its
        condition or its layout. Monthly neighbourhood figures in particular are volatile and
        should be read as direction rather than as value.
      </p>

      <h2>No agency relationship</h2>
      <p>
        Reading this site, sending an enquiry or receiving a reply does not create a client
        relationship or an agency relationship. A representation relationship is created only by a
        written agreement signed by both of us.
      </p>

      <h2>Property listings and search</h2>
      <p>
        Where this site links to a property search, that search is operated by a third party
        provider and the listing information in it belongs to the real estate board and the listing
        brokerages. We do not control that data and we do not warrant its accuracy or availability.
      </p>

      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>
        We link to third party websites including school boards, transit agencies, the City of
        Markham and government sources. We do not control those sites and we are not responsible
        for their content, their accuracy or their privacy practices.
      </p>

      <h2>Not a solicitation</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this site is intended to solicit buyers or sellers who are currently under
        contract with another brokerage.
      </p>

      <h2>Equal opportunity in housing</h2>
      <p>
        We provide services in accordance with the Ontario Human Rights Code. We do not
        discriminate on the basis of race, ancestry, place of origin, colour, ethnic origin,
        citizenship, creed, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age,
        marital status, family status or disability or any other protected ground.
      </p>

      <h2>Copyright</h2>
      <p>
        The writing, photography, design and code on this site are owned by Kirby Chan &amp; Co.
        Real Estate Team unless stated otherwise. You may link to these pages and quote briefly
        with attribution. You may not republish substantial portions without written permission.
      </p>
      <p>
        The typefaces used on this site, Montserrat and Lato, are distributed under the SIL Open
        Font License.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation</h2>
      <p>
        This site is provided as is. To the extent permitted by law we are not liable for any loss
        arising from reliance on the information published here. If something on this site is wrong,
        tell us at {site.contact.email} and we will correct it.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms. The date at the top of this page shows when they last changed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
